      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. can u add a part that specifically calls out how the school is overstepping its bounds? basically saying they are basically taking over the role of the parent when it comes to morality and values. and maybe mention that it's not just about 'intent' but about the fact that they are actually undermining the family's authority. can u make that part sound really strong?",
      "source": "evaluator"
